{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.MathlibExt.GramNondegenerate","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.GramNondegenerate","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.LinearAlgebra.SesquilinearForm.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.LinearAlgebra.Matrix.NonsingularInverse","lean:module:Mathlib.LinearAlgebra.Matrix.Determinant.Basic"],"declarations":5,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.GramNondegenerate.linearIndependent_of_gram_diagonal","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.GramNondegenerate.linearIndependent_of_gram_diagonal","kind":"theorem","line":101,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/GramNondegenerate.lean#L101-L116","doc":"**A family with a diagonal, nonvanishing Gram matrix is linearly\nindependent.** No symmetry, no nondegeneracy of `B` elsewhere. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.GramNondegenerate.inf_orthogonalBilin_eq_bot","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.GramNondegenerate.inf_orthogonalBilin_eq_bot","kind":"theorem","line":80,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/GramNondegenerate.lean#L80-L88","doc":"The same statement against a submodule already known to be that span — the\nshape a caller has when `W` is *defined* as `Submodule.span k (Set.range v)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.GramNondegenerate.span_inf_orthogonalBilin_eq_bot","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.GramNondegenerate.span_inf_orthogonalBilin_eq_bot","kind":"theorem","line":54,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/GramNondegenerate.lean#L54-L78","doc":"**The radical is trivial when the Gram matrix is invertible.**\n\n`x` in both the span and its orthogonal complement is a combination `∑ cᵢ vᵢ`\nwhose coefficient vector is killed by the Gram matrix; a nonzero determinant\nmakes `mulVec` injective, so `c = 0` and `x = 0`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.GramNondegenerate.gramMatrix_apply","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.GramNondegenerate.gramMatrix_apply","kind":"theorem","line":51,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/GramNondegenerate.lean#L51-L52","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.GramNondegenerate.gramMatrix","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.GramNondegenerate.gramMatrix","kind":"def","line":46,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/GramNondegenerate.lean#L46-L49","doc":"The **Gram matrix** of a family of vectors under a bilinear form:\n`gramMatrix B v i j = B (v i) (v j)`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}